Package: memequity
Type: Package
Title: Shared Core for the Memphis Service Equity Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Memphis Service Equity Project", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jpbranson@gmail.com")
Description: Shared geography layer, business-day calendar, statistical
    treatment (minimum-n suppression, Wilson and bootstrap intervals,
    censored medians), source-data validation harness, output-schema writers,
    metric-spec parsing and the publish gate used by every pipeline in the
    Memphis Service Equity project.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    sf,
    stats,
    survival,
    tools,
    utils,
    yaml
Suggests:
    curl,
    h3jsr,
    httr2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
